  "question": {
    "text": "The energy released during conversion of million atoms of iodine in gaseous state to iodide ions in gaseous state is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>.</mo></math> What is the electron gain enthalpy in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br />\r[Report your answer by rounding it upto nearset whole number]",
    "image": null
